config SCHED_CASS
	tristate "Capacity Aware Superset Scheduler task placement"
	depends on m && SMP && UCLAMP_TASK && CPU_FREQ_GOV_SCHEDUTIL && ANDROID_VENDOR_HOOKS
	help
	  Places CFS and RT tasks with the Capacity Aware Superset Scheduler
	  through the restricted scheduler vendor hooks, so the core scheduler
	  stays as it is. Light wakeups keep energy aware placement, an idle
	  smaller CPU is preferred for any task that fits it, and the busy share
	  of the last window keeps a floor under the schedutil clock for streams
	  of short tasks.
